  "title": "Always Juicy Baked Ham",
  "description": "All you need for this juicy baked ham is frequent basting with a sweet-tangy sauce made with brown sugar, mustard, and a bottle of good beer.",
  "authors": [
    "bitsybites"
  ],
  "date_published": "2010-03-08T14:39:57-05:00",
